# live pane at 40x100 (the dynamic region is 15 rows), shrunk to 12x60 twice — once after a quiet 0.3 s, once right
# after a keystroke (a paint pending in Ink's throttle, the race the pty storm scenario hits) — and grown back in
# between: each shrink segment costs exactly one clearTerminal (§18, research 20 §1), the grow none; Ctrl-C aborts the
# run and the session exits 0 through /exit
expect \x1b\[\?25l
expect Describe the task
sleep 0.3
send make the tests pass
sleep 0.2
send \r
expect ready
expect decisions s\d+
send steer draft
expect > (?:\x1b\[[0-9;]*m)*steer draft
sleep 0.3
resize 12 60
sleep 0.8
mark shrunk-quiet
resize 40 100
sleep 0.8
mark grown
send Z
resize 12 60
sleep 0.8
mark shrunk-after-key
resize 40 100
sleep 0.8
mark grown-again
send \x03
expect Type to steer
send \x03
expect end human_abort
expect Follow-up or /command
send /exit
sleep 0.2
send \r
eof
